WEBVTT

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Movie

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:38.340
Final check complete for the
unmanned probe, "Constellation."

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.240
Twenty minutes to departure.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.120
Countdown will begin five
minutesprior to departure.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.810
All personnel, please leave
the ship immediately.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:53.290
Repeat, all personnel, please
leave the ship immediately.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:00.900
Five minutes to departure.
Beginning countdown.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.610
Ten, nine,

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:12.100
eight, seven,

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.700
six, five,

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:18.400
four, three, two,

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.720
one, ignition!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.960
Welcome to "Fresh Morning."
I'm your host, Ippei Ohgi.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.930
Before today's news, a word
about a very important event.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:48.360
Sixteen years ago, a giant
meteor landed on this city...

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.850
with its population
of six million,

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.360
turning it to a mountain
of rubble in an instant.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:58.280
The blast leveled trees
for 50 kilometers around...

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:01.800
and the pillar of smoke could be
seen from 200 kilometers away.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.940
And yet, with the help
of the newest technology...

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:06.460
we were able to rebuild this city...

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:11.850
into the high-tech capitol
of the world in just 16 years.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.250
And today, our city has been
chosen as the site of the ceremony...

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:20.180
to commemorate the maiden voyage
of the deep-space probe, "Constellation."

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:25.780
This is a great honor, and I hope
you'll all be on hand to join.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:30.180
And now, news and weather
from across Japan.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.600
The big story today:
Many were injured in a riot...

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.920
that took place on
Spaceship QR. last night.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:40.130
The problem was resolved with
an apology from Spaceship L.F....

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.130
considered to be
the cause of the riot.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.740
And now the weather.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:46.860
For southern Japan...

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.800
skies will be clear enough to follow
a spaceship launch to 20,000 meters.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.280
Scattered clouds
throughout the east.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:58.200
For the north and west,
rain expected this afternoon

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.840
Look at the time!
I'm gonna be late!!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.800
A-ko! Time to go!

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:35.870
Good morning, A-ko!
We're gonna be late!

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:41.170
Oh, C-ko. I'm sorry.
I'll be right down!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.570
Sorry about that.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.450
You're such a sleepyhead!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.090
A-ko, I hope we can be
in the same class again.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.640
But really, C-ko, you didn't
have to quit on my account.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:07.060
But I wanted to be with you.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:07.600
Sorry.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:08.320
That's okay.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.570
Graviton High's just right for you.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.400
Ah! We're gonna be late!

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.370
Doesn't look like
we're going to make it.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.370
Now, where's the school?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.210
There it is!
We'll take a shortcut, C-ko.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.210
Are you serious!?

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:57.690
What a dull town.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.960
SORRY!

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.690
Class! Here are two brand
new friends for everyone.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.570
Girls, introduce yourselves!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:34.740
My name's A-ko Magami.
Nice to meet you.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:41.300
Hi-i-i! I'm C-ko Kotobuki!
Nice to meet you all!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:44.240
My, such a delightful introduction.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:47.250
Gee, I know we're cute, but you
all don't have to stare like that!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.740
How embarrassing!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:55.530
And Teacher, you're quite
a beauty, aren't you?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:05.160
Anyway, I just love this school.
This is so much fun!

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.980
Miss Kotobuki, that's
quite enough isn't it?

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.690
Oops! Got in trouble already!

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.320
C-ko.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.150
Now, your seats-

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:16.460
Teacher!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:18.660
Yes, B-ko? What is it?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.160
Teacher, the seats on
either side of me are empty.

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.340
So they are.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:28.100
Well then, A-ko, you sit by the
window, and C-ko, you can-

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.650
Aww! I wanna
sit by the window.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.670
That's okay.
Isn't it, Teacher?

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:39.360
W-Well, if it's all right with you.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.640
Whee!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.720
I get to sit by the window!!

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:52.320
Nice to meet-!?

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.200
Now, now, quiet everyone.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.260
Let's begin, shall we?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:10.370
Miss Kotobuki, would you PLEASE
face the front of the class!!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.290
Aww, how boring.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.710
But this place seems
like a lot of fun.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.220
I'm glad I came.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:34.820
Wow! Cool!!
I wanna try that too!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.340
Ow!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:41.820
Miss Kotobuki! How many
times do I have to tell you!?

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:56.590
M-Miss Kotobuki,
stop crying.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:01.560
Please stop crying,
won't you?

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.360
Here you go, A-ko.

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:14.600
Is this?

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:19.410
Yeah! I made it just for you.
Isn't it cute?

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:22.240
Uh, yeah. Very cute.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.240
Go ahead! Eat it!
It's really good!

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.250
Come on! Eat it!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.260
Well!? Isn't it good?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.440
A-ko! You're so mean!

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:51.120
I'll never make lunch for you again!
And it came out so pretty, too.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:01.800
I-I feel like I'm turning
into a monster!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:29.310
Agh-h! I feel like
I'm going to die.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.820
Uh-oh! Class is starting!

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:41.720
Who, why, what?
Tan, ku, chi?

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:44.820
Consequently, it is the
"We Are the World"...

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.330
of the Muromachi Period
that is "Aramahoshikere."

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:50.830
At daybreak,
the H2O is a fermata.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:56.480
Love in your Sigma Zeta, the path
of love is always of the Rias type.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.890
To the side! To the side!
The tank is passing.

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:02.860
Really, C-ko!
What kind of lunch was that!?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:05.680
Using sugar instead of salt?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.500
And steak sauce instead
of soy sauce? Gross.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:11.850
And that heart.
Where's your common sense?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.760
How embarrassing!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.820
But, A-ko!
I didn't mean to!

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.540
I-I'm sorry. I just got a little angry.
Don't cry, okay?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.160
QUIET!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:28.130
Your first day here, and you come
to school and then to class late!

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:30.370
Just what do you think school
is all about, anyway!?!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:36.290
C-ko, would you
PLEASE stop crying?

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.810
Just how old are you?

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.880
Teacher! Would you please
continue the class?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.880
I'm sorry. B-ko, be a dear
and translate from page 136.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.010
Yes, Ma'am.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.380
"George's gloomy nature was..."

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:52.180
Now, C-ko, stop crying, will you?

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.000
But... But A-ko...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.100
Really, A-ko!
Making C-ko cry like this!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.820
There, there, C-ko,
no more crying, okay?

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:03.780
A-ko, today you can clean
the classroom by yourself!.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.690
Hm?

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:07.400
B-ko, why did you stop?

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:12.910
I've finished translating.
All of it.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.910
What!?
You mean the whole book!?

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.500
Well, thank you, B-ko.
Let's continue, shall we?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.570
Eh!?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.140
Um, that's all for today, class.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.200
All rise!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.450
I'm sorry, A-ko.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:35.660
Now you have to clean up because of me.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.100
That's the way it goes.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.880
This'll take a while, so you
may as well go on ahead.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.780
No! I'm going home with you!

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.580
But it may take pretty long.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:48.020
I don't mind! I'll wait!

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:52.290
Oh well. In that case, why
don't you wait by the gate?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.340
I'll finish as soon as I can.

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:54.700
Okay!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.600
L-Let's go.

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:28.970
C-ko!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.870
A-ko's waiting for you
behind the gym!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.300
Really? What's she doing there?

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.380
She probably wants you
to help her with the trash!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:43.180
Yeah! I'll help!

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:45.260
I'll go, too!!

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.420
Say. Where's A-ko?

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:13.620
Just a bit further!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.580
Is A-ko here?

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:34.640
Silence! In seven seconds,
your life will end LIKE THAT!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:35.590
SCISSORS!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.060
Scissors, scissors!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:41.430
Yay! I win!!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.560
PAPER!!

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:48.420
I won again!!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.400
You're not very good, are you?
How cute!

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.120
A perfect strategy.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.690
First, C-ko and A-ko are separated.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:12.090
Then, I have Mari attack C-ko.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:16.000
Whereupon I save C-ko.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.000
C-ko becomes mine.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.720
And A-ko is out of the picture.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.320
Now what're you gonna do?

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:37.740
Mari! Calm down!
Don't get carried away! I mean...

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.950
What!? But it's too soon!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.960
C-ko?

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:08.360
Wait. It's too soon.
Stick with the plan!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.410
You're next!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.420
A-ko!

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.670
What are you doing to C-ko!?

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.680
What's this all about?

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:45.250
That block! The "Southern
Cross Fist" of the Okugi School?!!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:07.170
Cooll!
You're the best, A-ko!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.960
C-ko, are you all right?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.960
Yup, yup.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.440
Good. Let's call it a day.

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.440
Yeah! Let's go home!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:23.900
They're not here.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.680
C-ko. What an adorable girl.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:12.020
My heart hasn't stopped pounding
since the moment I first saw her.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:18.720
She's like an angel.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:23.280
I must make her mine.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.790
To do that, I'll have to get rid
of that nuisance, A-ko!!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:34.290
But even Mari was no match for her.
I'll have to be careful.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.320
Just you watch, A-ko!
I'll beat you!!

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:05.600
Yet I could swear
I've seen her before.

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:09.530
I'll have to investigate.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:40.770
Sorry!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:45.820
I-I think we'll make it today!

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:57.830
C-ko...

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:19.730
A-ko! What is this!?!
I thought I told you to clean up!

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.700
So how did it end up like this!?

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:28.860
You are going to take responsibility
and fix all this yourself.

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:29.570
Is that clear!?

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:39.650
Oh, boy.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:41.680
A-ko! A-ko!

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:47.860
C-ko?

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:49.920
Is that you?

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:55.210
LUNCHTIME!!

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.370
What's wrong?
Don't you feel well?

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:09.400
Oh, I see.
You can't eat it, can you?

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:14.580
You can't eat it.
You c-can't...

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:20.060
I KNOW!!
I've got a great idea.

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:23.900
Let's go see a movie! Okay?

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:28.160
Let's go, A-ko! LET'S GO!!!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.060
Huh? You'll go!?

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:32.810
Great!! Banzai!

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:35.930
Banzai!

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:06.290
Thank you!

00:24:27.920 --> 00:24:30.820
Wow! It's huge!

00:25:19.860 --> 00:25:22.280
Damn!!

00:25:19.860 --> 00:25:22.280
That was fun.

00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:27.250
I'm just glad
you're feeling better, A-ko.

00:25:27.600 --> 00:25:30.620
You were worried? Thanks.

00:25:30.620 --> 00:25:33.210
I didn't think
you ever worried about me.

00:25:33.210 --> 00:25:35.730
I'm not THAT insensitive.

00:25:35.730 --> 00:25:37.040
I'm sorry.

00:25:37.040 --> 00:25:40.530
We interrupt this program
for a news bulletin.

00:25:41.090 --> 00:25:45.000
Earlier today, all signals from the
Science Academy's deep-space probe...

00:25:43.400 --> 00:25:44.580
Let's go, A-ko!

00:25:44.580 --> 00:25:45.730
Y-Yeah.

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:49.530
"Constellation" ceased abruptly
in the neighborhood of lapetus.

00:25:50.530 --> 00:25:54.240
The "Constellation," which departed
from Space Station L-3 last week...

00:25:54.240 --> 00:25:58.450
was supposed to have passed Jupiter
before leaving the Solar System.

00:26:09.520 --> 00:26:12.920
Next time, let's ride to the top
of the Seaside Building.

00:26:12.920 --> 00:26:16.170
They've got a planetarium
and an aquarium there!

00:26:16.900 --> 00:26:18.550
Yeah. Let's come again.

00:26:20.800 --> 00:26:24.680
C-ko likes A-ko so much!

00:26:24.680 --> 00:26:27.770
Thanks! I like you too, C-ko.

00:26:45.850 --> 00:26:48.000
Wow! Would you look at that!?!

00:26:48.170 --> 00:26:50.680
Gee, Miss, I'm sorry about that.

00:26:50.680 --> 00:26:54.330
Who'd have thought the cable
would break like that?

00:26:54.330 --> 00:26:59.970
But, gee, that was something!
This is unbelievable!

00:27:00.290 --> 00:27:01.920
It's incredible!

00:27:01.920 --> 00:27:03.980
I can't believe it!

00:27:04.920 --> 00:27:06.860
Can I have your autograph?

00:27:07.530 --> 00:27:08.530
Thanks.

00:27:31.960 --> 00:27:33.980
What was that collision just now!?

00:27:33.980 --> 00:27:37.800
Something entered this space just as
we were coming out of hyperspace.

00:27:37.800 --> 00:27:39.240
Damage?

00:27:39.240 --> 00:27:42.890
A small crack is visible
in the hull of Block 21.

00:27:42.890 --> 00:27:43.970
Repair it immediately!

00:27:45.470 --> 00:27:48.050
Captain. A signal from "D."

00:27:48.050 --> 00:27:49.980
Again? Put him on.

00:27:50.250 --> 00:27:54.480
This is CD138621 S113,
code name "D."

00:27:54.480 --> 00:27:55.900
What is it, "D"?

00:27:55.900 --> 00:27:57.900
Well, Captain...Ouch!

00:27:58.580 --> 00:28:01.170
I believe I've finally
located someone...

00:28:01.170 --> 00:28:03.240
who may be the person
we've been looking for!

00:28:03.510 --> 00:28:05.900
What!? Really?

00:28:05.900 --> 00:28:06.740
I believe so.

00:28:07.130 --> 00:28:08.000
Have you confirmed?

00:28:08.000 --> 00:28:11.810
Not yet, but I'm 80% certain at this point.

00:28:11.810 --> 00:28:15.380
I think I'll have a more solid
confirmation next time I report.

00:28:15.380 --> 00:28:18.250
Right. Get on it!

00:28:28.900 --> 00:28:31.270
So we've finally
found her, have we?

00:28:58.490 --> 00:29:01.760
Miss, the report you requested.

00:29:01.760 --> 00:29:02.630
Thank you.

00:29:27.800 --> 00:29:29.830
Graduate of Yurikago Kindergarten

00:29:34.020 --> 00:29:35.830
I see. So that was it.

00:30:12.740 --> 00:30:14.750
Good morning!!

00:30:36.600 --> 00:30:38.230
Just as I thought.

00:30:40.230 --> 00:30:41.730
A-ko, did we just hit something?

00:30:41.730 --> 00:30:43.010
I think so.

00:30:56.280 --> 00:30:57.870
I've been waiting, A-ko.

00:31:00.720 --> 00:31:02.380
What is it, B-ko?

00:31:02.760 --> 00:31:06.380
We have some business
to settle from 10 years ago.

00:31:06.890 --> 00:31:09.880
Business from 10 years ago?
What're you talking about?

00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:15.390
You've forgotten about that time
in Yurikago Kindergarten?

00:31:16.980 --> 00:31:18.890
Yurikago Kindergarten!?

00:31:23.290 --> 00:31:26.900
You two haven't
changed a bit since then.

00:31:28.380 --> 00:31:32.120
After that incident,
that horrible incident...

00:31:33.740 --> 00:31:35.640
C-ko changed!!

00:31:42.340 --> 00:31:47.820
Yes, A-ko. After you came,
C-ko changed completely!!

00:31:50.320 --> 00:31:56.760
And after that, you were always,
always, ALWAYS together.

00:31:56.760 --> 00:31:58.850
No matter what!

00:31:59.370 --> 00:32:00.850
Always having so much fun.

00:32:02.650 --> 00:32:04.860
So much so that it made me furious!!

00:32:07.060 --> 00:32:12.660
A-ko, do you remember the girl who
challenged you to a fight to the finish?

00:32:13.500 --> 00:32:14.680
Fight to the finish!?

00:32:15.890 --> 00:32:17.360
A fight.

00:32:17.900 --> 00:32:20.820
10 years ago. Kindergarten?!

00:32:25.660 --> 00:32:26.730
Well?

00:32:32.380 --> 00:32:33.220
I remember!!

00:32:33.730 --> 00:32:35.980
What!? What!?

00:32:35.980 --> 00:32:40.850
Don't you remember the girl
who was always so mean to us?

00:32:43.020 --> 00:32:46.530
You know! With the bowl
haircut and the freckles.

00:32:46.530 --> 00:32:51.610
And the nasty look in her eyes!
She was always picking on you!

00:32:51.610 --> 00:32:56.180
Oh, yeah! I remember!
But you always protected me.

00:32:58.120 --> 00:33:02.130
And one day she and I were supposed
to have a fight to the finish...

00:33:02.130 --> 00:33:07.320
but I moved away that day.
I guess I blew her off.

00:33:07.320 --> 00:33:13.630
What was her name again?
B... Burp... Bug...

00:33:14.060 --> 00:33:18.080
What if that girl with the bowl haircut
and the freckles was me?

00:33:20.960 --> 00:33:22.780
YES! It was I, B-KO!

00:33:22.780 --> 00:33:25.480
WHAT?! No way!

00:33:25.930 --> 00:33:29.620
Well, A-ko? Shall we
settle that fight now?

00:33:29.620 --> 00:33:32.900
If I win, C-ko is mine!!

00:33:35.840 --> 00:33:37.700
Oh, come on!

00:33:37.700 --> 00:33:41.100
Why bring up ancient history now?

00:33:41.100 --> 00:33:43.420
This is embarrassing!

00:33:43.420 --> 00:33:45.540
Well, class is beginning, so-

00:33:45.140 --> 00:33:47.860
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:33:47.860 --> 00:33:50.960
Didn't you hear what I just said!?

00:33:50.960 --> 00:33:53.850
But that was 10 years ago!
I'm not interested!

00:33:53.850 --> 00:33:57.540
Besides, C-ko isn't an
object, you know!!

00:33:57.810 --> 00:33:59.470
Silence! Silence! Silence!!

00:34:00.370 --> 00:34:02.360
If I say we'll do it now,

00:34:03.050 --> 00:34:04.020
we'll do it!!

00:34:18.080 --> 00:34:21.440
You've had brute strength
since you were a child...

00:34:21.440 --> 00:34:23.810
but it seems you picked up
some skill along the way as well.

00:34:23.810 --> 00:34:27.210
Well, let's see you beat this
powered suit I've designed.

00:34:27.210 --> 00:34:29.210
Um, are you sure
this is a good idea?

00:34:29.210 --> 00:34:29.680
Silence!

00:34:29.680 --> 00:34:31.210
Y-Yes, Ma'am.

00:34:32.180 --> 00:34:34.010
Y-you call this
a fight to the finish!?

00:34:34.010 --> 00:34:34.710
A-ko...

00:34:34.940 --> 00:34:37.040
Sorry, but that's the way it is.

00:34:37.040 --> 00:34:39.100
If you're going to concede,
now's the time to do it.

00:34:39.100 --> 00:34:41.220
I won't be responsible.

00:34:42.980 --> 00:34:43.760
Go!!

00:35:01.530 --> 00:35:04.810
Wow! Way to go, A-ko!

00:35:04.810 --> 00:35:05.860
Oops! The bell!

00:35:05.860 --> 00:35:07.400
We're late! We're late!

00:35:08.890 --> 00:35:09.930
What?

00:35:10.380 --> 00:35:12.540
My brain...
I don't understand!

00:35:19.430 --> 00:35:23.900
With this, C-ko will be mine.
Tomorrow. Tomorrow's the day!

00:35:25.740 --> 00:35:28.430
A-ko, dear.
Just you wait and see!!

00:35:40.820 --> 00:35:42.530
We're gonna be late!!

00:35:48.810 --> 00:35:51.290
Today I'll confirm it for sure.

00:35:58.800 --> 00:36:02.250
Hey, wasn't that man
there yesterday, too?

00:36:02.250 --> 00:36:05.620
Oh yeah? I didn't notice.

00:36:07.720 --> 00:36:09.860
- B-ko!?
- A-ko.

00:36:09.860 --> 00:36:11.730
So you found the courage
to show up, did you?

00:36:11.900 --> 00:36:15.730
What!? Of course I did!
I came to school to study!

00:36:16.240 --> 00:36:21.200
Uh, yes, but... But that's not
what I'm talking about!

00:36:21.200 --> 00:36:23.240
Come on out, Max 5000!!

00:36:33.900 --> 00:36:37.520
Wow! Look at that!
What is it!?

00:36:39.520 --> 00:36:41.260
If you're surprised now,
just wait.

00:37:13.280 --> 00:37:14.680
Wow! Cool!!

00:37:14.680 --> 00:37:19.920
The ultimate "Spiner Machine":
Max 5000. Among its features are:

00:37:20.530 --> 00:37:23.170
One: The "Max Arm Crush."

00:37:23.170 --> 00:37:26.430
Its heavy-alloy drills can plow
through five meters of solid steel...

00:37:26.900 --> 00:37:29.430
and enable Max to move
underground at high speeds.

00:37:29.850 --> 00:37:31.680
Two: The "Max Bomber Saw."

00:37:31.680 --> 00:37:34.330
Tires from both sides are fired
at super-high speeds.

00:37:34.330 --> 00:37:36.940
Cutters extend,
shredding the target.

00:37:37.690 --> 00:37:39.460
Three: The "Max Beam."

00:37:39.460 --> 00:37:43.240
Heat beams, 10,000 degrees Celsius,
are fired from laser cannons.

00:37:43.940 --> 00:37:45.420
And Four: "Max Vision."

00:37:45.420 --> 00:37:48.770
Through super-high speed hovering,
Max creates the multiplied illusion.

00:37:49.660 --> 00:37:52.400
Max 5000:
Truly deserving of the name,

00:37:52.400 --> 00:37:54.050
The Blue God of Death!

00:37:54.050 --> 00:37:56.460
A-ko! For you,
there will be no tomorrow!!

00:37:56.890 --> 00:38:01.460
Now, then! Let A-ko experience
the full power of Max 5000!

00:38:02.610 --> 00:38:05.660
A-ko, it's late,
so I'll go on ahead.

00:38:06.800 --> 00:38:09.050
This is fun!

00:38:11.370 --> 00:38:13.520
What's the matter?
Go, I say!

00:38:16.290 --> 00:38:19.660
What's wrong?
Can't you hear me!?

00:38:19.660 --> 00:38:23.330
Uh, well, It's just that...

00:38:22.660 --> 00:38:25.210
What?! Speak up!

00:38:25.210 --> 00:38:27.210
Well...

00:38:27.940 --> 00:38:31.240
the levers are a bit hard to reach.

00:38:45.460 --> 00:38:46.940
Let's go!

00:38:48.530 --> 00:38:50.240
There's always tomorrow.

00:38:58.640 --> 00:39:01.230
It's perfect. PERFECT!

00:39:01.230 --> 00:39:03.370
A-ko, you're going to die.

00:39:03.370 --> 00:39:07.570
Die! D-I-I-E-E!!

00:39:22.280 --> 00:39:25.700
You're in a good mood today, A-ko!

00:39:25.700 --> 00:39:28.370
Of course!
I got up early today.

00:39:28.370 --> 00:39:30.580
We're sure to get there before B-ko does!

00:39:31.420 --> 00:39:34.200
Yahoo! Full power!

00:39:34.200 --> 00:39:35.620
Here we go!!

00:39:56.780 --> 00:40:01.020
I've been careless, standing in
the middle of the road like that.

00:40:01.020 --> 00:40:03.140
I should have realized sooner.

00:40:10.760 --> 00:40:12.280
Good morning!

00:40:12.280 --> 00:40:13.600
Guten Morgen!

00:40:14.160 --> 00:40:15.440
Good morning!

00:40:14.720 --> 00:40:16.860
You're early today, aren't you?

00:40:16.860 --> 00:40:19.300
Yes, Ma'am. Excuse us.

00:40:20.290 --> 00:40:22.020
My, how rare.

00:40:22.530 --> 00:40:24.570
We've got time to spare today.

00:40:24.570 --> 00:40:26.770
Yeah. Now if we can just avoid B-ko.

00:40:42.730 --> 00:40:43.930
It's A-ko!

00:40:43.930 --> 00:40:45.080
Hey, it's A-ko!

00:40:47.130 --> 00:40:48.590
I wonder
who'll win today?

00:40:55.640 --> 00:40:57.380
What's going on?

00:40:57.380 --> 00:40:59.100
I've been waiting, A-ko!!

00:41:04.760 --> 00:41:05.920
Wh-What is this?!?

00:41:05.920 --> 00:41:08.860
Wow! There's
a lot of them today!

00:41:10.260 --> 00:41:13.000
Today, we're really going
to settle things.

00:41:13.000 --> 00:41:15.320
Try to beat the Arashiyama Five!

00:41:15.620 --> 00:41:17.840
Aww, would you give it a rest!?

00:41:17.840 --> 00:41:22.290
Today we finally get to school early,
and you have to ruin it!

00:41:22.290 --> 00:41:26.080
And this time you come up
with these enormous things!

00:41:26.490 --> 00:41:27.840
Aren't they a little
out of date?

00:41:28.860 --> 00:41:32.850
A-ko, The depth of my vexation
is beyond your comprehension!!

00:41:32.850 --> 00:41:38.760
First, you take my one true love, C-ko,
now even my friends and peers.

00:41:39.280 --> 00:41:43.020
The gods may smile on you, A-ko,
but I never will!!

00:41:45.620 --> 00:41:47.540
Do you know
what she's talking about?

00:41:48.290 --> 00:41:51.460
Nope! Not at all!

00:41:53.460 --> 00:41:58.820
A-ko, since we got here so early,
why don't we go inside right away?

00:42:02.200 --> 00:42:05.340
You too, B-ko. Finish your
business and hurry along!

00:42:05.340 --> 00:42:08.630
Girls, let's all go inside now!

00:42:08.630 --> 00:42:10.630
Y-Yes, Ma'am!

00:42:11.650 --> 00:42:15.630
- What should we do?
- If we don't hurry, we'll be late.

00:42:15.630 --> 00:42:17.880
Hey! Why don't we
watch from inside?

00:42:17.880 --> 00:42:19.610
Yeah, that's a good idea.

00:42:19.610 --> 00:42:21.780
Quick! The bell's gonna ring!

00:42:29.850 --> 00:42:31.690
Hey! Wait for me!!

00:42:33.420 --> 00:42:38.160
Left in peace at last.
And now our battle begins.

00:42:39.660 --> 00:42:44.820
Today I woke up early.
This may never happen again!

00:42:44.820 --> 00:42:49.530
But you! You!
Over a stupid, petty...

00:42:49.530 --> 00:42:52.670
B-ko, you're an idiot!

00:43:40.010 --> 00:43:41.000
It can't be.

00:43:41.000 --> 00:43:42.000
B-ko!

00:43:43.060 --> 00:43:47.220
I'm late again today,
thanks to you!

00:43:47.580 --> 00:43:53.200
Just who do you think
you are!!

00:43:53.610 --> 00:43:56.410
What did you say!?
Why, you. You...

00:43:56.410 --> 00:43:58.720
And every day
you bring in more robots.

00:43:58.720 --> 00:43:59.400
Don't you ever learn!?!

00:43:59.400 --> 00:44:01.680
You think nothing else matters
as long as you're on time!?

00:44:01.820 --> 00:44:04.160
You've always been like that!

00:44:04.660 --> 00:44:06.600
Always playing
the good little girl!

00:44:06.600 --> 00:44:10.160
As long as you're all right,
you don't care about me, do you?

00:44:10.420 --> 00:44:13.600
I've always hated the fact
that you're always the hero...

00:44:13.600 --> 00:44:15.170
and I'm always the villain!!

00:44:15.690 --> 00:44:19.670
Well, fine!! If I'm the villain, then
I'll settle this like a villain should!

00:44:20.180 --> 00:44:22.680
Don't you think you're reading
too much into this?

00:44:23.040 --> 00:44:24.180
Silence!

00:44:33.080 --> 00:44:36.460
What do you think, A-ko?
This breathtaking "M" line.

00:44:36.460 --> 00:44:39.440
The Akagiyama 23!
This is what I'll take you on with!!

00:44:44.380 --> 00:44:46.000
What kind of name is that!?

00:44:46.000 --> 00:44:47.580
Can you believe it!?

00:44:47.580 --> 00:44:49.160
The worst!!

00:44:49.770 --> 00:44:51.700
What <i>is</i> that!?

00:44:51.700 --> 00:44:53.420
How embarrassing!

00:44:54.040 --> 00:44:55.170
Enough already!!

00:44:55.680 --> 00:44:57.340
C-come on.

00:44:58.960 --> 00:45:00.660
A-ko, I'll go on ahead.

00:45:00.660 --> 00:45:03.930
Sure. Could you answer for me
when the teacher calls my name?

00:45:03.930 --> 00:45:05.080
Yeah, bye bye!

00:45:05.080 --> 00:45:05.840
Here I come!

00:45:15.380 --> 00:45:17.930
Sorry, but this is going
to be the last time!!

00:45:18.400 --> 00:45:20.360
That's my line!

00:45:36.640 --> 00:45:37.970
Well? How is it?

00:45:37.970 --> 00:45:39.380
No interference at this point.

00:45:45.470 --> 00:45:50.180
So then it wasn't an accident
that destroyed the "Constellation"?

00:45:50.920 --> 00:45:55.160
That's how the Space Agency
and the higher-ups see it at this point.

00:45:55.620 --> 00:45:57.210
But then who?

00:45:57.980 --> 00:46:01.540
They say the ship was checked
thoroughly before departure...

00:46:01.540 --> 00:46:04.890
and that it's inconceivable that
explosives could have been planted.

00:46:05.730 --> 00:46:07.540
But, that would mean...!

00:46:07.540 --> 00:46:10.700
It's a strong possibility.

00:46:11.680 --> 00:46:13.570
Think about it.

00:46:13.570 --> 00:46:16.900
Doesn't it seem strange that
we were able to rebuild...

00:46:16.900 --> 00:46:19.840
and advance
in just 16 short years?

00:46:54.420 --> 00:46:56.060
A call from "D."

00:46:56.060 --> 00:46:57.440
Put it on.

00:46:57.440 --> 00:46:58.290
Understood.

00:46:58.290 --> 00:47:04.000
This is CD138621 S113,
code name "D"!

00:47:04.660 --> 00:47:07.530
You're in worse shape
every time you call.

00:47:07.530 --> 00:47:10.890
Uh, Yes, I've been throwing my
body and soul into the investigation.

00:47:12.060 --> 00:47:14.970
Well? What about that data?

00:47:14.970 --> 00:47:16.180
Sending now, Captain.

00:47:19.520 --> 00:47:21.060
Data received.

00:47:21.060 --> 00:47:22.380
Put it on the monitor.

00:47:22.380 --> 00:47:23.320
Routing it now.

00:47:24.240 --> 00:47:27.140
There may be some horizontal
bar noise and glitches...

00:47:27.140 --> 00:47:29.780
caused by accidents
during the investigation.

00:47:29.780 --> 00:47:31.970
It was set to auto-record,

00:47:31.970 --> 00:47:36.210
but the subject approaches and
recedes at such high speeds...

00:47:36.210 --> 00:47:38.250
that the sequence monitor
finally burned out.

00:47:38.250 --> 00:47:39.820
Since then,
I've been recording manually.

00:47:41.090 --> 00:47:43.400
That's a second
generation Egota class!

00:47:42.460 --> 00:47:47.650
The shutter was set to AE 11.
Aperture was 28 mm...

00:47:47.650 --> 00:47:50.300
and the shutter speed was,
I believe, 1/1000 sec.

00:47:50.300 --> 00:47:53.240
No doubt about it!!
That's the Princess!!

00:47:54.080 --> 00:47:55.810
Right! We'll start heading
your way immediately.

00:47:56.640 --> 00:47:59.730
Proceed to Phase Two
of your orders.

00:47:59.730 --> 00:48:02.810
Yes, Captain.
Proceeding to Phase Two.

00:48:03.850 --> 00:48:07.640
We've been wandering space
for 16 long years...

00:48:07.640 --> 00:48:09.820
but now it seems we'll be able
to return home at last.

00:48:11.500 --> 00:48:13.500
Empty? Damn!

00:48:14.000 --> 00:48:15.920
Just when I was
savoring the moment.

00:48:29.100 --> 00:48:29.840
What is it!?

00:48:30.220 --> 00:48:33.490
UFO has appeared within
our Sphere of Absolute Defense...

00:48:33.490 --> 00:48:35.000
and is approaching at high speed.

00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:37.530
It will hit the station in 40 seconds.

00:48:37.530 --> 00:48:38.890
What!?

00:48:40.770 --> 00:48:44.130
Object's fighting power estimated
to be above Level 300.

00:48:44.660 --> 00:48:46.400
Go to Level 2 battle stations!

00:48:46.400 --> 00:48:50.410
Roger! All strike units,
scramble immediately.

00:48:50.410 --> 00:48:54.400
Repeat, all strike units,
scramble immediately.

00:49:25.140 --> 00:49:27.410
All units standing by for departure.
All green!

00:49:27.410 --> 00:49:28.900
Roger! Commandeer.

00:49:30.530 --> 00:49:31.740
Launch strike units.

00:49:31.740 --> 00:49:34.900
Aye, sir. Strike units, launch!!

00:49:55.360 --> 00:49:58.140
All units,
enter attack formation "E"!

00:49:58.370 --> 00:50:01.720
Repeat, all units,
enter attack formation "E"!

00:50:01.720 --> 00:50:04.660
Target maintaining speed
and has penetrated Red 2.

00:50:04.660 --> 00:50:06.660
Target may attempt to
penetrate atmosphere.

00:50:06.660 --> 00:50:08.530
Strike units,
move to intercept!

00:50:08.530 --> 00:50:09.110
Roger!

00:50:27.480 --> 00:50:28.820
What's happening!?

00:50:28.820 --> 00:50:29.740
Surprise attack!

00:50:29.740 --> 00:50:30.970
Engage synchronic deflectors!!

00:50:30.970 --> 00:50:32.930
Hydrotaun pressure dropping.

00:50:32.930 --> 00:50:34.460
The enemy is
from the third planet.

00:50:35.050 --> 00:50:37.800
What!? Those barbarians.

00:50:37.800 --> 00:50:41.320
Is this the kind of planet
the Princess is on?

00:50:41.320 --> 00:50:44.970
We've got to save the Princess
and escort her home.

00:50:45.930 --> 00:50:48.760
When the second attacks comes
strike back immediately!

00:50:48.760 --> 00:50:51.730
Crush any
who stand in our way!!

00:51:35.860 --> 00:51:37.290
I-It's huge!

00:51:37.290 --> 00:51:38.570
What a monster!!

00:52:00.300 --> 00:52:03.490
Captain, we've located
their home base.

00:52:03.490 --> 00:52:07.270
We haven't time for games!
Dispose of them immediately!!

00:53:02.100 --> 00:53:05.200
Fool! Don't you know that
evil can never prevail!?

00:53:05.200 --> 00:53:07.330
A-ko! Prepare for defeat!

00:53:50.180 --> 00:53:51.420
Silly girl!

00:53:52.250 --> 00:53:54.410
I'm just beginning!!

00:54:16.020 --> 00:54:17.720
That was too easy.

00:54:22.970 --> 00:54:25.010
Hah! You're good,
A-ko! But...

00:54:25.010 --> 00:54:27.610
NOT GOOD ENOUGH!

00:54:32.890 --> 00:54:35.500
Don't you see that
you haven't a chance?

00:54:35.820 --> 00:54:38.580
Then I'll make you see
with your whole body!

00:54:48.100 --> 00:54:50.970
"The Black Jacovini
Shooting Star Lash!"

00:54:55.720 --> 00:54:56.940
Take that!

00:54:57.580 --> 00:54:59.050
And that!

00:54:59.530 --> 00:55:01.740
AND THAT!

00:55:08.060 --> 00:55:10.570
"Screw Kick"!

00:55:13.790 --> 00:55:14.790
"Akagiyama Missile"!

00:55:25.620 --> 00:55:28.210
I've got to move this fight
to someplace better.

00:55:28.970 --> 00:55:30.760
And just where do you think
you're going, A-ko!?

00:55:31.090 --> 00:55:33.260
On track number five,
a cuckoo,

00:55:33.480 --> 00:55:35.260
moving along life's path,
with all its variation...

00:55:35.260 --> 00:55:38.520
I wonder where A-ko's gone?

00:55:38.520 --> 00:55:41.010
I answered for her when the
teacher called her name, but...

00:55:41.010 --> 00:55:42.270
C-ko!

00:55:42.690 --> 00:55:43.780
Ah, Teacher.

00:55:43.780 --> 00:55:47.560
What do you mean, "Ah, Teacher"?
What's going on?!

00:55:47.560 --> 00:55:49.560
Where are A-ko and B-ko?

00:55:49.560 --> 00:55:52.540
Um, well, you see...

00:55:53.600 --> 00:55:54.280
A-ko!

00:55:55.160 --> 00:55:58.980
C-ko! Where are you going!?
Come back!!

00:56:02.160 --> 00:56:05.290
What on earth is that
silly girl thinking?

00:56:08.050 --> 00:56:12.450
Girls! Where do you think
you're going!? Stop!

00:56:16.280 --> 00:56:18.810
A-ko, where did you go?

00:56:21.130 --> 00:56:23.820
A-ko, A-ko...

00:56:28.210 --> 00:56:29.280
Climb in.

00:56:31.420 --> 00:56:35.030
Well? You're worried
about A-ko, aren't you?

00:56:35.730 --> 00:56:36.740
But...

00:56:41.850 --> 00:56:42.830
Let's go!

00:56:42.830 --> 00:56:45.450
Are you coming or not!?

00:56:45.450 --> 00:56:46.210
Yeah.

00:56:53.160 --> 00:56:56.180
I see smoke!
They must be over there!!

00:56:59.000 --> 00:56:59.970
Take that!!

00:57:08.280 --> 00:57:09.820
Akagiyama Missile!

00:57:09.820 --> 00:57:10.690
Agh! Not that again!

00:57:24.490 --> 00:57:26.460
The enemy spaceship has
penetrated the atmosphere.

00:57:27.020 --> 00:57:29.960
The advance force will make
contact in five minutes.

00:57:30.820 --> 00:57:32.470
So they've come.

00:57:36.540 --> 00:57:38.460
Headquarters, this is Apple 1 .

00:57:38.460 --> 00:57:42.540
Still no visual contact,
but I have 'em on radar.

00:57:43.480 --> 00:57:45.040
Apple 1 to all units!

00:57:45.040 --> 00:57:47.920
Take 'em higher and try to
get a bead on the target.

00:57:47.920 --> 00:57:49.330
All units, move!!

00:58:54.260 --> 00:58:56.280
So this is the enemy!?

00:58:56.650 --> 00:58:59.050
A 6500 meter-long monstrosity.

00:59:00.930 --> 00:59:03.760
Apple 1 to Headquarters.
Target confirmed.

00:59:03.760 --> 00:59:06.060
Beginning attack
according to plan.

00:59:12.640 --> 00:59:15.280
Attack force
engaging enemy air forces!

01:00:46.440 --> 01:00:48.480
Would you cool it, B-ko?

01:00:55.210 --> 01:00:57.380
Sheesh, you're persistent.

01:01:08.240 --> 01:01:13.820
Hey! What're you doing here!?
All residents must evacuate!!

01:01:13.820 --> 01:01:17.150
En garde, A-ko!!
"Muscle Attack"!

01:01:18.580 --> 01:01:20.340
"Akagiyama Missile"!

01:01:32.810 --> 01:01:34.680
A-ko, where are you?

01:01:34.680 --> 01:01:37.960
I'm sure they're
around here somewhere.

01:01:38.450 --> 01:01:41.520
But there's something strange
about the city.

01:01:41.520 --> 01:01:44.970
Now that you mention it,
there are tanks and stuff all over.

01:01:45.370 --> 01:01:47.850
Ah! There they are!
I'm sure!

01:01:47.850 --> 01:01:49.240
Where!? Where!?

01:01:49.240 --> 01:01:51.470
Mari, just hang on
a little longer!

01:01:54.350 --> 01:01:55.190
Double-Kick!

01:01:59.220 --> 01:02:02.740
"A-ko Tank Cannon," fire!!

01:02:03.080 --> 01:02:04.820
"Spider Shot"!

01:02:05.070 --> 01:02:06.570
"Spider Shot," countered!

01:02:14.300 --> 01:02:17.000
A-ko!

01:02:18.170 --> 01:02:18.930
C-ko?

01:02:18.930 --> 01:02:22.510
A-ko! B-ko!

01:02:25.980 --> 01:02:29.010
C-ko?
What're you doing here?

01:02:29.240 --> 01:02:33.130
It's past noon, A-ko!
You must be hungry!

01:02:33.570 --> 01:02:36.520
Look! I brought your lunch!!

01:02:37.020 --> 01:02:39.060
I surrender!

01:02:44.190 --> 01:02:45.320
Wha-!?

01:02:50.920 --> 01:02:54.040
Ah! A-ko's lunch!!

01:02:57.600 --> 01:02:58.740
C-ko!

01:03:10.080 --> 01:03:12.680
You intend to abandon
our battle and go where?!

01:03:13.260 --> 01:03:17.810
Where!? Didn't you see that!?
C-ko was just taken away!

01:03:17.810 --> 01:03:19.810
Don't you care at all!?

01:03:20.300 --> 01:03:21.380
W-Well, I...

01:03:21.380 --> 01:03:23.860
We've got to get C-ko back
before we do anything else!

01:03:26.840 --> 01:03:30.870
Hey. You're not the only one who...
Wait for me, A-ko!

01:03:34.370 --> 01:03:37.540
Why you lousy!
Put me down! Take me back!!

01:03:37.540 --> 01:03:40.200
P-Please,
Miss, don't interfere.

01:03:41.730 --> 01:03:43.380
Please don't cry!

01:03:43.380 --> 01:03:46.210
You're going home
to your own planet!

01:03:46.210 --> 01:03:47.690
I don't know
what you're talking about!

01:03:47.690 --> 01:03:51.740
I wanna see A-ko!!
Help!! Rape!

01:03:51.740 --> 01:03:55.600
Wha-?! What a thing to say!
Hold on, we're taking off!.

01:03:55.600 --> 01:03:58.390
I'll be a good girl!
Just don't rape me. HELP!!!

01:04:22.410 --> 01:04:26.920
You realize that this is only
until we've rescued C-ko.

01:04:27.480 --> 01:04:28.690
All right, already!

01:04:39.130 --> 01:04:41.360
A-ko! You can't die yet.

01:04:42.190 --> 01:04:43.310
Oh, well.
That's the breaks!

01:04:54.600 --> 01:04:57.490
Hey! Move it! I can't see!

01:05:13.080 --> 01:05:14.080
What?

01:05:52.180 --> 01:05:54.300
Size isn't everything, you know.

01:06:19.640 --> 01:06:20.490
Princess....

01:06:22.610 --> 01:06:26.180
Princess, why have you closed
your heart to us?

01:06:27.210 --> 01:06:28.410
Why..?

01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:37.170
Captain.

01:06:37.760 --> 01:06:38.470
What is it?

01:06:38.880 --> 01:06:41.890
Forgive the intrusion,
but you're needed on the bridge.

01:06:41.890 --> 01:06:43.260
On my way.

01:07:09.040 --> 01:07:10.750
"Driver Kick"!

01:07:33.440 --> 01:07:35.530
What is it?

01:07:36.500 --> 01:07:39.690
Forgive me, Captain,
but some rats have gotten in.

01:07:39.690 --> 01:07:41.070
Rats, you say?

01:07:41.070 --> 01:07:41.820
Yes.

01:07:41.820 --> 01:07:46.020
It seems the Princess´ companions
have chased her to our ship.

01:07:46.020 --> 01:07:47.720
What!?

01:07:47.720 --> 01:07:52.040
Leave it to me, Captain.
I'll take care of them in no time.

01:08:00.560 --> 01:08:01.760
What was that!?

01:08:06.680 --> 01:08:08.810
C-ko! So this is
where you've been.

01:08:34.380 --> 01:08:37.090
C-ko, what's wrong!?

01:08:37.850 --> 01:08:40.010
They done something to you,
haven't they...

01:08:44.460 --> 01:08:45.480
Hm?

01:08:45.930 --> 01:08:47.660
Wh-Where am I?

01:08:47.660 --> 01:08:49.660
B-ko, what's going on?

01:08:49.660 --> 01:08:53.800
You poor thing.
They drugged you, didn't they?

01:08:53.800 --> 01:08:56.610
Oh, I remember!
I cried myself to sleep.

01:08:58.260 --> 01:09:00.650
Anyway, let's get out of here.

01:09:00.650 --> 01:09:02.170
Where's A-ko?

01:09:02.170 --> 01:09:04.650
C-ko! Who cares about A-ko?

01:09:04.650 --> 01:09:05.740
Let's get out of here.

01:09:06.680 --> 01:09:09.120
I wanna be with A-ko!!

01:09:08.690 --> 01:09:11.080
Now, now, don't cry.

01:09:11.880 --> 01:09:17.080
Now, then. How to escape?
I can't take C-ko out the window.

01:09:17.080 --> 01:09:19.080
Maybe if I steal
one of their planes...

01:09:47.420 --> 01:09:49.620
Yick! Dirty laundry!

01:09:50.770 --> 01:09:52.620
What is this place?

01:09:53.880 --> 01:09:57.180
Where did all these come from!?

01:10:08.180 --> 01:10:09.180
Wha-!?

01:10:26.100 --> 01:10:28.460
You dodged that nicely!

01:10:28.460 --> 01:10:29.990
That was dirty!
Attacking from behind!

01:10:33.440 --> 01:10:36.810
I can't let you
proceed any further!

01:10:37.570 --> 01:10:41.460
If you do, it will be
over my dead body!!

01:10:48.410 --> 01:10:50.120
Stop jumping away like that.

01:10:50.120 --> 01:10:52.140
I'll put you to rest
before you know what happened.

01:10:52.140 --> 01:10:54.850
Hey, now! Cut that out!

01:11:03.460 --> 01:11:04.880
How dare you!

01:11:05.500 --> 01:11:08.910
How dare you
scar a young girl's face!

01:11:21.570 --> 01:11:24.460
You think you can
beat me so easily!?!

01:11:33.100 --> 01:11:36.730
I can't.
I can't run anymore!

01:11:46.940 --> 01:11:50.700
Maybe that's an exit there!
This place is a maze!

01:12:23.340 --> 01:12:24.480
Gotcha!!

01:12:46.880 --> 01:12:47.460
What in blazes!?

01:12:48.100 --> 01:12:49.770
So you're the boss, huh!?

01:12:49.770 --> 01:12:51.720
Give me back my friend!!

01:12:52.010 --> 01:12:53.340
Your friend, you say?

01:12:54.930 --> 01:12:59.840
That child is the Fourth Princess
of the Fifth Queen...

01:12:59.840 --> 01:13:02.350
of the Lepton Kingdom of Alpha Cygni-

01:13:00.240 --> 01:13:02.350
What're you mumbling about!?

01:13:02.350 --> 01:13:04.520
Give me my friend!!

01:13:05.130 --> 01:13:08.120
I see there's no point in talking
to this ignorant creature.

01:13:10.330 --> 01:13:11.360
What's wrong?

01:13:11.770 --> 01:13:13.280
The booze has worn off.

01:13:13.280 --> 01:13:16.900
What!?
Just give me back my friend!!

01:13:16.900 --> 01:13:20.250
T-To hell with that! I need booze!
If I don't get some booze...

01:13:21.090 --> 01:13:23.970
Huh? Wrong again.

01:13:24.340 --> 01:13:25.500
Oh! A-ko!

01:13:25.860 --> 01:13:27.880
C-ko! You're all right!?

01:13:27.880 --> 01:13:28.500
Princess!?

01:13:28.850 --> 01:13:31.250
A-ko. So you're alive.

01:13:31.250 --> 01:13:33.100
A-ko!

01:13:33.100 --> 01:13:34.120
No matter.

01:13:34.120 --> 01:13:38.260
I've saved C-ko,
and our cease-fire is over!!

01:13:42.480 --> 01:13:43.730
How dare you?!

01:13:47.220 --> 01:13:48.500
That's really low, B-ko!

01:13:49.140 --> 01:13:50.730
A-ko! I missed you!!

01:13:52.100 --> 01:13:53.700
Why you!

01:13:54.100 --> 01:13:56.700
Stop it, you idiot!
You'll hit the Princess!

01:14:01.380 --> 01:14:03.160
Stop it! Stop, I say!!

01:14:03.160 --> 01:14:06.540
Ah! Stay away from there, fools!

01:14:06.970 --> 01:14:09.210
"D"! The bridge is
no place for a battle!

01:14:09.490 --> 01:14:11.530
You bastard! Stop!

01:14:11.530 --> 01:14:14.810
Stop! Please stop!
Stop, dammit!!

01:14:14.260 --> 01:14:15.720
So you want to fight, do you!?

01:14:23.760 --> 01:14:25.020
Why, you!

01:14:37.850 --> 01:14:39.200
Booze! I need booze!!

01:14:39.200 --> 01:14:42.020
Booze, booze, booze,
booze, booze, booze!!

01:14:45.330 --> 01:14:47.830
Oh no, that's bad! This is...

01:14:57.680 --> 01:14:59.800
Huh? What's happening?

01:15:16.690 --> 01:15:21.080
Ah, it's all over!
We're going crash! Crash!!

01:16:45.300 --> 01:16:49.000
Not only the double cherry blossoms,
but also the seven lights of-

01:16:54.620 --> 01:16:56.900
What on Earth...

01:16:56.900 --> 01:16:57.590
AH!?

01:17:00.560 --> 01:17:01.840
Hi, Teach!

01:17:02.460 --> 01:17:04.570
Teacher!

01:17:04.570 --> 01:17:07.020
Yahoo!

01:17:07.020 --> 01:17:09.160
Yahoo!

01:17:09.160 --> 01:17:16.040
Yahoo, Ayumi-sensei!

01:17:16.040 --> 01:17:20.460
Yahoo! It's me, C-ko!

01:17:20.460 --> 01:17:22.820
Yahoo!

01:17:22.820 --> 01:17:25.450
Everyone's just fine!

01:17:25.450 --> 01:17:26.870
Yahoo!

01:17:45.260 --> 01:17:48.810
Mmm, just a little bit longer.

01:18:11.640 --> 01:18:13.960
Right! Looking good!

01:18:15.370 --> 01:18:17.880
A-ko! Time to go!

01:18:23.180 --> 01:18:24.170
I'm off!.

01:18:25.010 --> 01:18:26.040
Good morning, C-ko.

01:18:26.040 --> 01:18:26.730
Morning!

01:18:26.730 --> 01:18:27.530
Shall we go?

01:18:27.530 --> 01:18:28.380
Yep.

01:19:06.720 --> 01:19:09.720
Love will save
the universe.

01:19:06.720 --> 01:19:09.720
We're all brothers.

01:19:06.720 --> 01:19:09.720
Your donation
can help.

01:19:06.720 --> 01:19:09.720
Love will save
the universe.

01:19:06.720 --> 01:19:09.720
We're all brothers.

01:19:06.720 --> 01:19:09.720
Your donation
can help.
